@startuml

title Observing a fixing at system level, applying it at party level

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

box "System level" #F4F4F8
participant "Fixing source" as source
database "Fixing observations" as store
actor "Super administrator" as admin
end box

box "Party level: one party that holds trades" #FFFFFF
actor "Party operations" as ops
participant "Fixings manager" as fm
participant "Product services" as products
database "Party trades" as trades
end box

== Observe (system level) ==
source -> store : publish the observation
store -> store : store it once for every party
admin -> store : view every observation across every source

== Subscribe (party level) ==
products -> fm : a booked trade names its fixing schedule
fm -> store : read the observations the party's trades require
fm -> fm : the party fixing is unofficial

== Authorise ==
ops -> fm : compare with the front-office rate
ops -> fm : authorise, or overkey and authorise
fm -> fm : the party fixing is official;\nthe observation is unchanged

== Apply ==
fm -> products : fix event (party fixing, version)
products -> trades : find the party's trades whose schedule names it
products -> trades : book coupons, fixing trades and cash,\nlabelled with the event
products --> fm : progress; excluded books reported

== Undo ==
ops -> fm : undo for all the party's trades, a time,\na book, a currency or a trade
fm -> products : undo event (scope)
products -> trades : reverse every action labelled\nwith the fix event
fm -> fm : the party fixing is unofficial

@enduml
